[00:20.234]Lost in time
[00:23.859]Forgotten and ignored
[00:27.856]Out of place
[00:31.660]Abandoned by the world
[00:35.020]I watched as I sank into the abyss
[00:39.275]Waiting for a hero to break my fall
[00:42.530]'Till I realized there's no one that could save me
[00:48.342]But myself
[00:50.716]I can't depend
[00:52.795]I'm on my own
[00:54.592]Forever, ever, ever, and forevermore
[00:58.216]I reach out my hand to an empty void
[01:02.249]I search for the answers of an unknown world
[01:05.983]I write out my life as my story unfolds
[01:09.985]I hope, someday I could save the day
[01:13.641]I cry out for help to a silent abyss
[01:17.596]A losing battle with no end in sight
[01:21.548]Still I will try 'cause I know I'll survive
[01:25.438]I hope, one day I can be the main heroine
[01:32.282]Whoa~
[01:44.891]Left behind
[01:48.031]Out of mind and out of sight
[01:52.486]Still, I stand
[01:55.875]'Cause a heroine never dies
[01:59.829]I won't find my place, 'cause I'll create it
[02:03.751]A miracle waits in front of me
[02:07.640]Little by little, I can save the world if I start
[02:12.903]with myself
[02:15.155]The reflection on, the water surface
[02:18.742]was the hero I, met in my dreams
[02:23.130]How many times
[02:24.662]I'll save my life
[02:26.910]Again, again, again, again,
[02:28.693]Again, again, again, again, and over again
[02:32.318]I reached out my hand to an empty void
[02:36.787]I searched for the answers of an unknown world
[02:40.566]I wrote out my life as my story unfolds
[02:44.488]I know, that soon I will save my life
[02:48.269]I came to my rescue and fought till the end
[02:51.847]'Cause this story still has a chapter left to write
[02:56.173]Stood strong until I took a step back and saw
[02:59.754]that I've already become the main heroine
[03:06.569]Whoa~
[03:19.736]"Even if I'm okay with being in the sidelines
[03:23.149]Even if I'm fine with being an afterthought
[03:26.524]Even if I've accepted being outside of the spotlight
[03:30.349]It gets a little tiring filling the supporting role, doesn't it?"
[03:35.350]"Although it doesn't seem like I'm doing something of worth,
[03:39.015]Although it might not look like I'm doing something out of certainty,
[03:43.499]Although it may not feel like I'm doing something heroic,
[03:47.161]I know I'll have touched at least one heart, at least one life"
[03:53.291]"But what is the purpose of the main heroine?"
[03:56.872]"Is it to save the world?
[03:59.782]Is it to save just one person?
[04:02.938]Is it to save myself?"
[04:08.486]"Is it all even worth it?..."
